[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3925793944","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116466#issuecomment-3925793944","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116466","id":3925793944,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7p_tyY","user":{"login":"Yagich","id":24468819,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDY4ODE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24468819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich","html_url":"https://github.com/Yagich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-19T09:12:04Z","updated_at":"2026-02-19T09:12:25Z","body":"it's not wrong per se. `observed` is indeed `nil` since the engine does not have the actual data for the property. the property needs to \"exist\" (either being a real property or proxied in some way by overriding `_set` and `_get`):\n\n```gdscript\n@export_tool_button(\"Get Properties\", \"Callable\") var prop_action = get_props\n\n@export var compared: Array[int]\n\nvar fake\n\nfunc _get_property_list():\n\tvar properties = []\n\t\n\tproperties.append({\n\t\t\"name\": \"observed\",\n\t\t\"type\": TYPE_ARRAY,\n\t\t\"hint\": PROPERTY_HINT_TYPE_STRING,\n\t\t\"hint_string\": \"%d:\" % [TYPE_INT],\n\t\t\"usage\": 4102,\n\t})\n\treturn properties\n\n\nfunc _set(property: StringName, value: Variant) -> bool:\n\tif property == \"observed\":\n\t\tfake = value\n\t\treturn true\n\t\n\treturn false\n\n\nfunc _get(property: StringName) -> Variant:\n\tif property == \"observed\":\n\t\treturn fake\n\t\n\treturn null\n\n\nfunc get_props():\n\tfor info in get_property_list():\n\t\tif info.name == \"compared\" or info.name == \"observed\":\n\t\t\tprint(info)\n\tnotify_property_list_changed()\n```\n\nthis will let you edit the property, although `(Nil) Array[int]` will be shown initially (because the property `fake` is initialized to `null`), clicking on it will properly assign an array value (thanks to the property hint) and you can edit it as expected.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3925793944/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3929781878","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116466#issuecomment-3929781878","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116466","id":3929781878,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qO7Z2","user":{"login":"ssaenger","id":28540972,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NTQwOTcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28540972?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger","html_url":"https://github.com/ssaenger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-19T20:25:16Z","updated_at":"2026-02-19T20:25:16Z","body":"@Yagich Hey thanks for your input. That totally makes sense. I should have done a bit more investigating. Sorry for taking up your time. I'll play with this tonight and see what I can do :)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3929781878/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3931598045","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116466#issuecomment-3931598045","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116466","id":3931598045,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qV2zd","user":{"login":"ssaenger","id":28540972,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NTQwOTcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28540972?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger","html_url":"https://github.com/ssaenger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaenger/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02